      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Efficiency was studied of laser acupuncture and quercetin in patients with ischemic heart disease (IHD) with concurrent chronic cholecystitis. Multimodality quantum and antioxidant therapy treatments were found out to have a beneficial effect on the clinical course of both the underlying disease and the concomitant pathologies of the biliary system, making for improvement of hemodynamics and contractile function of the myocardium, returning the hepatic circulation to normal in IHD patients with concomitant chronic cholecystitis that did not respond to conventional therapies."},
